00:29:14.140 --> 00:29:19.960
But it seems like in the game
whether you want to do the

00:29:19.960 --> 00:29:23.770
good thing or not it generally
works to your advantage to do

00:29:23.770 --> 00:29:26.520
the good thing because you get
more stuff, either better

00:29:26.520 --> 00:29:29.020
