00:29:31.360 --> 00:29:32.910
Whereas, being the jerk--

00:29:32.910 --> 00:29:35.976
AUDIENCE: It kind of depends
on who your companions are.

00:29:35.976 --> 00:29:37.344
GUEST SPEAKER: Does it?

00:29:37.344 --> 00:29:38.535
Who approves?

00:29:38.535 --> 00:29:40.724
AUDIENCE: People like the--

00:29:40.724 --> 00:29:42.849
AUDIENCE: Like Elven assassin,
I can't remember

00:29:42.849 --> 00:29:43.488
