00:29:43.488 --> 00:29:44.802
GUEST SPEAKER: Oh, Zevran.

00:29:44.802 --> 00:29:46.330
AUDIENCE: [UNINTELLIGIBLE]

00:29:46.330 --> 00:29:49.088
but she likes all the
