00:29:51.358 --> 00:29:52.490
That's why [UNINTELLIGIBLE].

00:29:52.490 --> 00:29:55.030
AUDIENCE: Also that one
guy, [UNINTELLIGIBLE]

00:29:57.620 --> 00:29:58.800
that can spot
[INTERPOSING VOICES]

00:29:58.800 --> 00:30:00.686
No, no, another guy.

00:30:00.686 --> 00:30:03.000
I think you can get him
