00:32:38.730 --> 00:32:39.145
GUEST SPEAKER: The what?

00:32:39.145 --> 00:32:40.910
AUDIENCE: The Cube murder
in [INTERPOSING VOICES]

00:32:40.910 --> 00:32:42.910
GUEST SPEAKER: Oh, the Cube.

00:32:42.910 --> 00:32:47.926
I'm thinking Q. Yeah, that would
be closed because you

00:32:47.926 --> 00:32:50.704
