just have to deal with your--

00:32:50.704 --> 00:32:52.100
AUDIENCE: But that's the joke.

00:32:52.100 --> 00:32:53.454
AUDIENCE: Yeah, yeah.

00:32:53.454 --> 00:32:54.704
Exactly.

00:32:56.650 --> 00:32:58.794
AUDIENCE: Starification
