00:33:18.163 --> 00:33:19.654
GUEST SPEAKER: Which one?

00:33:19.654 --> 00:33:22.150
AUDIENCE: The Sleep Is Death
griefing directly under

00:33:22.150 --> 00:33:22.420
[UNINTELLIGIBLE].

00:33:22.420 --> 00:33:27.201
Like the idea that I am a GM,
