00:33:30.995 --> 00:33:32.310
to play along with you.

00:33:32.310 --> 00:33:33.920
But that's part of the game.

00:33:33.920 --> 00:33:35.968
So I don't know that
[UNINTELLIGIBLE]

00:33:35.968 --> 00:33:38.413
closed or open.

00:33:38.413 --> 00:33:42.325
That tension's intended.

00:33:42.325 --> 00:33:45.259
GUEST SPEAKER: I don't know.

00:33:45.259 --> 00:33:47.690
AUDIENCE: It's still
open, right?

00:33:47.690 --> 00:33:50.910
GUEST SPEAKER: I would say this
one is open, I guess,

00:33:50.910 --> 00:33:53.960
because you are allowed
to do what you want.

00:33:53.960 --> 00:33:56.350
The example he gives for closed
ended is-- one of

00:33:56.350 --> 00:34:02.105
them-- is Manhunt where you have
to kill the bull and the

00:34:02.105 --> 00:34:04.940
