00:34:31.719 --> 00:34:33.530
So you would say that's
a closed system.

00:34:39.185 --> 00:34:42.050
AUDIENCE: [UNINTELLIGIBLE] and
Indigo Prophecy might be

00:34:42.050 --> 00:34:46.730
