open, yeah.

00:36:35.350 --> 00:36:36.835
AUDIENCE: [UNINTELLIGIBLE]

00:36:36.835 --> 00:36:37.825
kicking people.

00:36:37.825 --> 00:36:39.409
GUEST SPEAKER: You don't
