00:36:39.805 --> 00:36:41.290
AUDIENCE: No.

00:36:41.290 --> 00:36:44.260
[INAUDIBLE]

00:36:44.260 --> 00:36:45.260
GUEST SPEAKER: OK.

00:36:45.260 --> 00:36:48.010
So most of these-- what, do we
say about [UNINTELLIGIBLE]?

00:36:48.010 --> 00:36:48.916
AUDIENCE: Oh.

00:36:48.916 --> 00:36:50.166
AUDIENCE: Open.

00:36:52.656 --> 00:36:58.140
