would that be open or closed?

00:36:58.140 --> 00:36:59.460
AUDIENCE: Well [UNINTELLIGIBLE]
open--

00:36:59.460 --> 00:37:01.260
AUDIENCE: You have a choice
but it's in your best

00:37:01.260 --> 00:37:04.300
interests to do one
or the other.

00:37:04.300 --> 00:37:06.292
[INTERPOSING VOICES]

00:37:06.292 --> 00:37:10.380
AUDIENCE: So if you have only
one thing you can do it's

00:37:10.380 --> 00:37:11.540
fairly closed.

00:37:11.540 --> 00:37:14.170
If you have only two things
you can do that are very

00:37:14.170 --> 00:37:17.078
clearly defined is it really an
open system or is it just a

00:37:17.078 --> 00:37:18.695
