the system was

00:37:25.534 --> 00:37:28.992
determining whether what you
were doing was good or bad.

00:37:28.992 --> 00:37:30.968
AUDIENCE: I was thinking
[UNINTELLIGIBLE].

00:37:30.968 --> 00:37:32.944
I thought inFAMOUS
[UNINTELLIGIBLE]

00:37:32.944 --> 00:37:35.414
would also be closed.

00:37:35.414 --> 00:37:36.664
AUDIENCE: [UNINTELLIGIBLE]

00:37:38.822 --> 00:37:40.794
I didn't get the difference
between only having one option

00:37:40.794 --> 00:37:43.259
