you which option

00:37:43.259 --> 00:37:47.696
is the right option.

00:37:47.696 --> 00:37:52.590
So in that case some of these
turn from open to close.

00:37:52.590 --> 00:37:54.880
AUDIENCE: Like this one.
{INTERPOSING VOICES]

00:37:54.880 --> 00:37:57.220
AUDIENCE: BioShock would
then be closed.

00:37:57.220 --> 00:38:00.328
Fallout 3 The Dream Land,
would that be closed?

00:38:00.328 --> 00:38:03.056
AUDIENCE: It isn't telling
you which choice

00:38:03.056 --> 00:38:03.304
is the right option.

00:38:03.304 --> 00:38:07.870
You needn't be morally
[UNINTELLIGIBLE].

00:38:07.870 --> 00:38:09.540
GUEST SPEAKER: What
do you think?

00:38:09.540 --> 00:38:11.830
Do you think he's saying--

00:38:11.830 --> 00:38:13.205
I know what you're saying
because he also mentioned Ice

00:38:13.205 --> 00:38:15.315
Field Republic as
a closed option.

00:38:18.330 --> 00:38:22.870
Is it that there are two
discrete, like good or evil,

00:38:22.870 --> 00:38:26.700
like the Jedi or
the dark path?

00:38:26.700 --> 00:38:29.400
Is Fallout that concrete?

00:38:29.400 --> 00:38:31.050
Fallout 3.

00:38:31.050 --> 00:38:34.950
I know inFAMOUS is.

00:38:34.950 --> 00:38:37.760
You're either going one
way or the other.

00:38:37.760 --> 00:38:40.025
But I'm not as sure, and I'm
just asking people who've

00:38:40.025 --> 00:38:44.606
played it, is Fallout 3 that
particular in is it setting up

00:38:44.606 --> 00:38:45.928
a dichotomy of the good
character versus

00:38:45.928 --> 00:38:48.373
evil, or is it much--

00:38:48.373 --> 00:38:49.840
AUDIENCE: It's much more
of a gradient.

00:38:49.840 --> 00:38:51.796
AUDIENCE: Yeah.

00:38:51.796 --> 00:38:53.752
[UNINTELLIGIBLE]

00:38:53.752 --> 00:38:56.020
AUDIENCE: In Baldur's Gate
there's two things.

00:38:56.020 --> 00:38:57.310
There's your alignment,
which you pick at the

00:38:57.310 --> 00:38:58.998
beginning of the game.

00:38:58.998 --> 00:39:02.832
It's more like D&D style
but it's fixed.

00:39:02.832 --> 00:39:07.970
But then there's this thing
that's your reputation, which

00:39:07.970 --> 00:39:11.400
can be decreased if you do
certain things, from the game

00:39:11.400 --> 00:39:13.545
point of view, in view others.

00:39:13.545 --> 00:39:16.530
So you can get into doing bad
stuff sometimes without

00:39:16.530 --> 00:39:18.170
actually decreasing
your reputation.

00:39:18.170 --> 00:39:22.802
You can also just pick a evil
alignment and then do only

00:39:22.802 --> 00:39:25.142
good things, and that's
just very weird.

00:39:25.142 --> 00:39:27.860
So I don't exactly remember
how the alignment really

00:39:27.860 --> 00:39:29.020
factors into game play.

00:39:29.020 --> 00:39:30.370
But there's a moment, for
example, in the game, there's

00:39:30.370 --> 00:39:31.970
a big story for--

00:39:31.970 --> 00:39:35.460
it rejoins it afterwards-- but
you you have to ally yourself

00:39:35.460 --> 00:39:39.960
with either the Thieves Guild
or the vampires in town who

00:39:39.960 --> 00:39:42.420
are competing affections.

00:39:42.420 --> 00:39:44.700
So you have the thieves
against the vampires.

00:39:44.700 --> 00:39:46.726
If it's the thieves against the
vampires you got to pick

00:39:46.726 --> 00:39:52.790
one to help you raid a certain
area, and you don't really

00:39:52.790 --> 00:39:54.160
have other choices.

00:39:54.160 --> 00:39:58.020
And one doesn't make you
gooder or eviler.

00:39:58.020 --> 00:39:59.070
They're both kind of bad.

00:39:59.070 --> 00:40:01.800
But you have to do it to
find the person that

00:40:01.800 --> 00:40:03.740
you're trying to get.

00:40:03.740 --> 00:40:06.650
That's kind of closed.

00:40:06.650 --> 00:40:10.200
AUDIENCE: So in terms of
Baldur's Gate II, I would say,

00:40:10.200 --> 00:40:12.790
one, there's the reputation
stats, which I've found never

00:40:12.790 --> 00:40:14.310
really into the
[UNINTELLIGIBLE], which is

00:40:14.310 --> 00:40:15.700
some type of metric for your--

00:40:15.700 --> 00:40:17.290
AUDIENCE: That's not true.

00:40:17.290 --> 00:40:19.696
AUDIENCE: You kill everyone
and you have to go

00:40:19.696 --> 00:40:21.690
[UNINTELLIGIBLE] to do that.

00:40:21.690 --> 00:40:24.300
People in your party can duel
you for your honor if they get

00:40:24.300 --> 00:40:25.280
