else unhappy.

00:41:40.655 --> 00:41:44.120
So then I had to
kill a zombie.

00:41:44.120 --> 00:41:45.120
It was sad.

00:41:45.120 --> 00:41:48.070
So that was another
element to it.

00:41:48.070 --> 00:41:49.900
One of the things that he talks
about in general in

00:41:49.900 --> 00:41:55.030
relation to all of this, and a
lot of these fit is ethics to

00:41:55.030 --> 00:41:57.570
