00:41:57.570 --> 00:42:01.190
That somehow ethical systems are
on this point or sliding

00:42:01.190 --> 00:42:03.685
scale and that you're heading
towards good or you're heading

00:42:03.685 --> 00:42:04.560
towards evil.

00:42:04.560 --> 00:42:07.880
We were even mentioning this
before class started that you

00:42:07.880 --> 00:42:11.530
can blow up an entire town but
then if you give three beggars

00:42:11.530 --> 00:42:15.215
$0.50 cents each suddenly you're
back at neutral because

00:42:15.215 --> 00:42:18.804
of the way that these sliding
systems work in bizzarely

00:42:18.804 --> 00:42:20.090
mechanical ways.

00:42:20.090 --> 00:42:22.144
AUDIENCE: Yeah, you can
